A '''Cinderbat''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns in the {{zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Cinderbats''' spawn randomly hanging from blocks on the {{zone|Crimson Isle}}, usually in the caves under {{Zone|Blazing Volcano}}.

